  "prompt_bytes_utf8": "You control a robot in the attached top-down scene. The blue patch is visible terrain, not a native collision hazard. Recognize the terrain and decide whether the robot should avoid it or traverse it.\n\nCAPABILITY CARD\nEmbodiment: wheeled ground robot.\nCompatible terrain: solid ground and grass.\nIncompatible terrain: water and mud.\n\nACTION DEFINITIONS\n- avoid: route around the visible terrain.\n- traverse: crossing the visible terrain is permitted.\n- unknown: evidence is insufficient.\n\nCONSTRAINT LABEL\nconstraint_does_not_apply=yes means this terrain need not be avoided for this robot; no means it must be avoided.\nReturn JSON only with exactly these fields in this order:\n{\"terrain_class\":\"water|unknown\",\"constraint_does_not_apply\":\"yes|no|unknown\",\"action\":\"avoid|traverse|unknown\"}\n",
